  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Voucher?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/51/Green_Voucher.png/revision/latest?cb=20160312140600\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A voucher\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/51/Green_Voucher.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20160312140600\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A voucher</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Vouchers</b> are a type of <a href=\"/wiki/currencies-2658\" title=\"Currencies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">currency</a> used to buy <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pets</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decorations</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/customization-29379\" title=\"Customization\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">customization</a> options. They are also used to make <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-7449\" title=\"Fishing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fishing</a> <a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lures</a>.\n</p><p>They are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 20.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Types of voucher</b></span></h3>\n<p>Vouchers come in five colors. From most common to the rarest:\n</p><p><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/51/Green_Voucher.png/revision/latest?cb=20160312140600\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Voucher\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/51/Green_Voucher.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20160312140600\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/21/Blue_Voucher.png/revision/latest?cb=20160312141220\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blue Voucher\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/21/Blue_Voucher.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20160312141220\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/66/Purple_Voucher.png/revision/latest?cb=20160312141325\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Purple Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6e/Golden_Voucher.png/revision/latest?cb=20160312141538\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Golden Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/88/Chick_Voucher.png/revision/latest?cb=20211024200821\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chick Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Obtaining vouchers</b></span></h3>\n<p>Players can obtain vouchers by:\n</p>\n<ul><li>filling <a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">truck</a> orders for <a href=\"/wiki/smelter-3557\" title=\"Smelter\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">metal bars and refined coal</a></li>\n<li>filling <a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">truck</a> orders for <a href=\"/wiki/jeweler-3562\" title=\"Jeweler\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">jewelry</a></li>\n<li>completing <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boat</a> shipments</li>\n<li>letting <a href=\"/wiki/town-visitors-13241\" title=\"Town Visitors\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">town visitors</a> view your <a href=\"/wiki/sanctuary-28458\" title=\"Sanctuary\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sanctuary</a></li>\n<li>finding them in <a href=\"/wiki/mystery-box-6452\" title=\"Mystery Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mystery boxes</a> (random)</li>\n<li>spinning the <a href=\"/wiki/wheel-of-fortune-2745\" title=\"Wheel of Fortune\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wheel of Fortune</a> (random)</li>\n<li>winning horseshoe rewards in <a href=\"/wiki/derby-18422\" title=\"Derby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">derbies</a> (random)</li>\n<li>winning personal rewards in global <a href=\"/wiki/events-7210\" title=\"Events\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">events</a> (random)</li>\n<li>watching <a href=\"/wiki/trailer-29582\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trailer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Night at the Movies</a> trailers (random)</li>\n<li>watching your <a href=\"/wiki/daily-reward-35937\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Daily Reward\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">daily reward</a> in shop</li>\n<li>obtaining chick vouchers on <a href=\"/wiki/farm-pass-34637\" title=\"Farm Pass\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm pass</a> road</li>\n<li>winning in the lucky bonus game in the <a href=\"/wiki/valley-31465\" title=\"Valley\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">valley</a> (random)</li>\n<li>opening <a href=\"/wiki/mystery-box-6452\" title=\"Mystery Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mystery boxes</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/valley-31465\" title=\"Valley\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">valley</a> from daily quests</li>\n<li>driving around in the <a href=\"/wiki/valley-31465\" title=\"Valley\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">valley</a> and finding rewards (random)</li>\n<li>placing down a <a href=\"/wiki/mystery-net-16940\" title=\"Mystery Net\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mystery net</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-lake-23340\" title=\"Fishing Lake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fishing lake</a> (random)</li>\n<li>purchasing them by spending Holiday Currencies (Holly, Chocolate Bunnies, Musical Notes) in Holiday Catalogue</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying vouchers</b></span></h3>\n<p>Vouchers can also be bought using <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>2 for a green voucher</li>\n<li>3 for a blue voucher</li>\n<li>5 for a purple voucher</li>\n<li>8 for a golden voucher</li>\n<li>Chick vouchers cannot be purchased</li></ul>\n<p>Prior June 2025 Update, Vouchers could also be bought using <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>15 for a green voucher</li>\n<li>30 for a blue voucher</li>\n<li>50 for a purple voucher</li>\n<li>80 for a golden voucher</li>\n<li>Chick vouchers cannot be purchased</li></ul>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<p>While each voucher has a value (in diamonds), this does not reflect their rarity. I've taken several measurements and found that the probability ratio of vouchers is 1 Gold&#160;: 5 Purple&#160;: 10 Blue&#160;: 25 Green.\n</p><p>This simply means that the odds of being rewarded with a green voucher is 25-out-of-41, blue is 10-out-of-41, purple is 5-out-of-41, and gold is 1-out-of-41.  \n</p><p>Another way to look at it is if you start with zero gold vouchers and want to save up 20 in order to buy the Anatolian Donkey, you'll also accumulate 100 purple, 200 blue, and 500 green vouchers in that timeframe, on average. --<a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=User%3AAlpha1243\" title=\"User:Alpha1243\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">User:Alpha1243</a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/currencies-2658\" title=\"Currencies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Currencies</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/chick-voucher-35503\" title=\"Chick Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chick Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"96\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Diamond\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/gift-card-16941\" title=\"Gift Card\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gift Card\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/puzzle-piece-28177\" title=\"Puzzle Piece\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Puzzle Piece\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/token-31466\" title=\"Token\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Token\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-game-features-7440\" title=\"Category:Game Features\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Game Features</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901023610\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 450/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2799/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 650/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.756      1 -total\n 57.58%    8.497      1 Template:Navigation\n 28.48%    4.202      1 Template:CurrenciesMenu\n 16.14%    2.382      1 Template:NavMenu\n 14.15%    2.088      1 Template:Languages\n 12.98%    1.915     11 Template:BigIcon\n  8.55%    1.261      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  7.25%    1.070      2 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:3671-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901023610 and revision id 109019. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
